      "content": "hey, i need some help with my smart home setup. i've been noticing these really weird patterns with my nest thermostat and my hue lights lately. like, the temp drops specifically around 11pm and the lights shift to this weird dim amber color, but only on certain nights. i checked my schedules and there's nothing set up for this. it feels... intentional. like someone might be messing with my account or the hub. can you help me figure out a way to track the logs so i can see if there's an outside login or something?",
