      "content": "i did that but the logs just look normal, like there's no \"unauthorized\" login or anything. but it's too consistent to be a glitch. it's like someone knows exactly when i'm winding down for the night and is trying to mess with my head by changing the vibe of the house. my ex used to do stuff like this to get under my skin before. \n\nif the official logs aren't showing it, is there a way to log the specific *changes* themselves? like, can i write a script or use something to record every single time the temp or light color changes so i can look for a pattern? i need to see if these changes actually correlate to when my ex might be online or something.",
